  "notes": "## 修复\n\n- **Windows 的 Emby 页面重试不再永久转圈**：WebView 首次加载失败后的重试导航现在有\n  15 秒硬超时。此前重试路径直接等待 `loadUrl`；底层 WebView 如果既不完成也不抛错，\n  加载遮罩会永久留在屏幕上，只能强退应用。\n\n## 兼容性\n\n账号、订阅、协议、更新签名公钥与各平台升级身份均未改变。\n内核基线 mihomo v1.19.30；Flutter 3.47.2 / Dart 3.13.2。\n",
  "notesEn": "## Fixed\n\n- **Retrying the Emby page on Windows can no longer spin forever**: navigation\n  after an initial WebView load failure now has a hard 15-second timeout. The\n  retry path previously awaited `loadUrl` without a bound; if the underlying\n  WebView neither completed nor threw, the loading overlay stayed on screen\n  until the application was force-quit.\n\n## Compatibility\n\nAccounts, subscriptions, protocols, update-signing keys, and per-platform\nupgrade identities are unchanged. Core baseline mihomo v1.19.30;\nFlutter 3.47.2 / Dart 3.13.2.\n",
